  triage:title "DecisionSchema::input returns Result<Self::Input, JevError>, but the only implementation (" ;
  triage:description "DecisionSchema::input returns Result<Self::Input, JevError>, but the only implementation (Canonical) returns the payload unchanged and cannot fail. D4.1 says input_bytes does not call it, so it is a fake-fallible method with no production caller. Recommendation: Return Self::Input directly, or drop the method until a variant needs it." ;
